Cell["\<\
This notebook accompanies the paper, \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Quasinormal modes \
analysis of a massive scalar field in a Schwarzschild background via the \
Spectral Method\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], by Davide Batic, Anna Chrysostomou, \
Alan S. Cornell, and Denys Dutykh.
Figures 1 and 2 were generated with this notebook.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.8949714265846167`*^9, 3.894971432437641*^9}, 
